ctive resume entry."},"389":{"title":"Resume Execution","description":"Resume a paused workflow execution by providing input for a specific pause context. The execution continues from where it paused, using the provided input. Supports synchronous, asynchronous, and streaming modes (determined by the original execution's configuration).","url":"/en/api-reference/human-in-the-loop/resumeExecution","content":"Resume Execution — Resume a paused workflow execution by providing input for a specific pause context. The execution continues from where it paused, using the provided input. Supports synchronous, asynchronous, and streaming modes (determined by the original execution's configuration)."},"390":{"title":"List Workflows","description":"Retrieve all workflows in a workspace with cursor-based pagination.","url":"/en/api-reference/workflows/listWorkflows","content":"List Workflows — Retrieve all workflows in a workspace with cursor-based pagination."},"391":{"title":"Get Workflow","description":"Retrieve details for a single workflow, including its input fields and deployment status.","url":"/en/api-reference/workflows/getWorkflow","content":"Get Workflow — Retrieve details for a single workflow, including its input fields and deployment status."},"392":{"title":"Get Job Status","description":"Poll the status of an asynchronous workflow execution. Use the jobId returned from the Execute Workflow endpoint when the execution is queued asynchronously.","url":"/en/api-reference/workflows/getJobStatus","content":"Get Job Status — Poll the status of an asynchronous workflow execution. Use the jobId returned from the Execute Workflow endpoint when the execution is queued asynchronously."},"393":{"title":"Query Logs","description":"List workflow execution logs with advanced filtering and cursor-based pagination. Supports filtering by workflow, trigger type, date range, duration, cost, and more.","url":"/en/api-reference/logs/queryLogs","content":"Query Logs — List workflow ex