n for the billing period."},"399":{"title":"List Tables","description":"List all tables in a workspace. Returns table metadata including name, schema, and row counts.","url":"/en/api-reference/tables/listTables","content":"List Tables — List all tables in a workspace. Returns table metadata including name, schema, and row counts."},"400":{"title":"Create Table","description":"Create a new table in a workspace. Define the table schema with typed columns, optional constraints (required, unique), and a name.","url":"/en/api-reference/tables/createTable","content":"Create Table — Create a new table in a workspace. Define the table schema with typed columns, optional constraints (required, unique), and a name."},"401":{"title":"Get Table","description":"Retrieve a table's metadata, schema, and row count.","url":"/en/api-reference/tables/getTable","content":"Get Table — Retrieve a table's metadata, schema, and row count."},"402":{"title":"Delete Table","description":"Delete a table and all its rows. This action is irreversible.","url":"/en/api-reference/tables/deleteTable","content":"Delete Table — Delete a table and all its rows. This action is irreversible."},"403":{"title":"Add Column","description":"Add a new column to the table schema. Optionally specify a position to insert the column at a specific index.","url":"/en/api-reference/tables/addColumn","content":"Add Column — Add a new column to the table schema. Optionally specify a position to insert the column at a specific index."},"404":{"title":"Update Column","description":"Update a column's name, type, or constraints. Multiple updates can be applied in a single request. When renaming, subsequent updates (type, constraints) use the new name.","url":"/en/api-reference/tables/updateColumn","content":"Update Column — Update a column's name, type, or constraints. Multiple updates can be applied in a single request. When renaming, subsequent updates (type, constraints) use the new name."},"405":{"title":"Delete Column","description":"Delete a column from the table schema. This removes the column definition and strips the corresponding key from all existing row data. Cannot delete the last remaining column.","url":"/en/api-reference/tables/deleteColumn","content":"Delete Column — Delete a column from the table schema. This removes the column definition and strips the corresponding key from all existing row data. Cannot delete the last remaining column."},"406":{"title":"List Rows","description":"Query rows from a table with optional filtering, sorting, and pagination. Filters and sorts are passed as JSON-encoded query parameters.","url":"/en/api-reference/tables/listRows","content":"List Rows — Query rows from a table with optional filtering, sorting, and pagination. Filters and sorts are passed as JSON-encoded query parameters."},"407":{"title":"Insert Rows","description":"Insert one or more rows into a table. For a single row, pass a `data` object. For batch insert, pass a `rows` array (up to 1000 rows).","url":"/en/api-reference/tables/insertRows","content":"Insert Rows — Insert one or more rows into a table. For a single row, pass a `data` object. For batch insert, pass a `rows` array (up to 1000 rows)."},"408":{"title":"Batch Update Rows","description":"Update multiple specific rows by their IDs in a single request. Each entry in the `updates` array specifies a row ID and the fields to update. Validates against the table schema and unique constraints. Up to 1000 rows can be updated per request.","url":"/en/api-reference/tables/batchUpdateRows","content":"Batch Update Rows — Update multiple specific rows by their IDs in a single request. Each entry in the `updates` array specifies a row ID and the fields to update. Validates against the table schema and unique constraints. Up to 1000 rows can be updated per request."},"409":{"title":"Delete Rows","description":"Delete rows by filter criteria or by an explicit list of row IDs. Pass either a `filter` object or a `rowIds` array.