e, Content-Disposition, and Content-Length headers. File metadata is included in custom response headers: X-File-Id, X-File-Name, X-Uploaded-At.","url":"/es/api-reference/files/downloadFile","content":"Download File — Download a file's content. Returns the raw file bytes with appropriate Content-Type, Content-Disposition, and Content-Length headers. File metadata is included in custom response headers: X-File-Id, X-File-Name, X-Uploaded-At."},"846":{"title":"Delete File","description":"Delete a file from a workspace. This removes both the file content and its metadata. This action is irreversible.","url":"/es/api-reference/files/deleteFile","content":"Delete File — Delete a file from a workspace. This removes both the file content and its metadata. This action is irreversible."},"847":{"title":"List Knowledge Bases","description":"List all knowledge bases in a workspace.","url":"/es/api-reference/knowledge-bases/listKnowledgeBases","content":"List Knowledge Bases — List all knowledge bases in a workspace."},"848":{"title":"Create Knowledge Base","description":"Create a new knowledge base in a workspace. Optionally configure chunking parameters for document processing.","url":"/es/api-reference/knowledge-bases/createKnowledgeBase","content":"Create Knowledge Base — Create a new knowledge base in a workspace. Optionally configure chunking parameters for document processing."},"849":{"title":"Get Knowledge Base","description":"Get details of a specific knowledge base.","url":"/es/api-reference/knowledge-bases/getKnowledgeBase","content":"Get Knowledge Base — Get details of a specific knowledge base."},"850":{"title":"Delete Knowledge Base","description":"Soft-delete a knowledge base and all its documents.","url":"/es/api-reference/knowledge-bases/deleteKnowledgeBase","content":"Delete Knowledge Base — Soft-delete a knowledge base and all its documents."},"851":{"title":"Update Knowledge Base","description":"Update a knowledge base's name, description, or chunking confi