etailed information about a specific paused execution, including its pause points, execution snapshot, and resume queue. Use this to inspect the state before resuming."},"1683":{"title":"Get Paused Execution (Resume Path)","description":"Get detailed information about a specific paused execution using the resume URL path. Returns the same data as the workflow paused execution detail endpoint.","url":"/de/api-reference/human-in-the-loop/getPausedExecutionByResumePath","content":"Get Paused Execution (Resume Path) — Get detailed information about a specific paused execution using the resume URL path. Returns the same data as the workflow paused execution detail endpoint."},"1684":{"title":"Get Pause Context","description":"Get detailed information about a specific pause context within a paused execution. Returns the pause point details, resume queue state, and any active resume entry.","url":"/de/api-reference/human-in-the-loop/getPauseContext","content":"Get Pause Context — Get detailed information about a specific pause context within a paused execution. Returns the pause point details, resume queue state, and any active resume entry."},"1685":{"title":"Resume Execution","description":"Resume a paused workflow execution by providing input for a specific pause context. The execution continues from where it paused, using the provided input. Supports synchronous, asynchronous, and streaming modes (determined by the original execution's configuration).","url":"/de/api-reference/human-in-the-loop/resumeExecution","content":"Resume Execution — Resume a paused workflow execution by providing input for a specific pause context. The execution continues from where it paused, using the provided input. Supports synchronous, asynchronous, and streaming modes (determined by the original execution's configuration)."},"1686":{"title":"List Workflows","description":"Retrieve all workflows in a workspace with cursor-based pagination.","url":"/de/api-reference/workflows/listWorkflows","content":"List Workflows — Retrieve all workflows in a workspace with cursor-based pagination."},"1687":{"title":"Get Workflow","description":"Retrieve details for a single workflow, including its input fields and deployment status.","url":"/de/api-reference/workflows/getWorkflow","content":"Get Workflow — Retrieve details for a single workflow, including its input fields and deployment status."},"1688":{"title":"Get Job Status","description":"Poll the status of an asynchronous workflow execution. Use the jobId returned from the Execute Workflow endpoint when the execution is queued asynchronously.","url":"/de/api-reference/workflows/getJobStatus","content":"Get Job Status — Poll the status of an asynchronous workflow execution. Use the jobId returned from the Execute Workflow endpoint when the execution is queued asynchronously."},"1689":{"title":"Query Logs","description":"List workflow execution logs with advanced filtering and cursor-based pagination. Supports filtering by workflow, trigger type, date range, duration, cost, and more.","url":"/de/api-reference/logs/queryLogs","content":"Query Logs — List workflow execution logs with advanced filtering and cursor-based pagination. Supports filtering by workflow, trigger type, date range, duration, cost, and more."},"1690":{"title":"Get Log Details","description":"Retrieve detailed information about a specific log entry, including workflow metadata, execution data, and cost breakdown.","url":"/de/api-reference/logs/getLogDetails","content":"Get Log Details — Retrieve detailed information about a specific log entry, including workflow metadata, execution data, and cost breakdown."},"1691":{"title":"Get Execution Details","description":"Retrieve the full execution state snapshot, including the workflow state at time of execution and detailed metadata.","url":"/de/api-reference/logs/getExecutionDetails","content":"Get Execution Details — Retrieve the full execution state snapshot, including the workflow state at time of execution and detailed metadata."},"1692":{"title":"List Audit Logs","description":"Retrieve audit logs for your organization with cursor-based pagination. Requires an Enterprise subscription and organization admin or owner role.","url":"/de/api-reference/audit-logs/listAuditLogs","content":"List Audit Logs — Retrieve audit logs for your organization with cursor-based pagination. Requires an Enterprise subscription and organization admin or owner role."},"1693":{"title":"Get Audit Log Details","description":"Retrieve a single audit log entry by ID. Requires an Enterprise subscription and organization admin or owner role.","url":"/de/api-reference/audit-logs/getAuditLogDetails","content":"Get Audit Log Details — Retrieve a single audit log entry by ID. Requires an Enterprise subscription and organization admin or owner role."},"1694":{"title":"Get Usage Limits","description":"Retrieve your current rate limits, usage spending, and storage consumption for the billing period.","url":"/de/api-reference/usage/getUsageLimits","content":"Get Usage Limits — Retrieve your current rate limits, usage spending, and storage consumption for the billing period."},"1695":{"title":"List Tables","description":"List all tables in a workspace. Returns table metadata including name, schema, and row counts.","url":"/de/api-reference/tables/listTables","content":"List Tables — List all tables in a workspace. Returns table metadata including name, schema, and row counts."},"1696":{"title":"Create Table","description":"Create a new table in a workspace. Define the table schema with typed columns, optional constraints (required, unique), and a name.","url":"/de/api-reference/tables/createTable","content":"Create Table — Create a new table in a workspace. Define the table schema with typed columns, optional constraints (required, unique), and a name."},"1697":{"title":"Get Table","description":"Retrieve a table's metadata, schema, and row count.","url":"/de/api-reference/tables/getTable","content":"Get Table — Retrieve a table's metadata, schema, and row count."},"1698":{"title":"Delete Table","description":"Delete a table and all its rows. This action is irreversible.","url":"/de/api-reference/tables/deleteTable","content":"Delete Table — Delete a table and all its rows. This action is irreversible."},"1699":{"title":"Add Column","description":"Add a new column to the table schema. Optionally specify a position to insert the column at a specific index.","url":"/de/api-reference/tables/addColumn","content":"Add Column — Add a new column to the table schema. Optionally specify a position to insert the column at a specific index."},"1700":{"title":"Update Column","description":"Update a column's name, type, or constraints. Multiple updates can be applied in a single request. When renaming, subsequent updates (type, constraints) use the new name.","url":"/de/api-reference/tables/updateColumn","content":"Update Column — Update a column's name, type, or constraints. Multiple updates can be applied in a single request. When renaming, subsequent updates (type, constraints) use the new name."},"1701":{"title":"Delete Column","description":"Delete a column from the table schema. This removes the column definition and strips the corresponding key from all existing row data. Cannot delete the last remaining column.","url":"/de/api-reference/tables/deleteColumn","content":"Delete Column — Delete a column from the table schema. This removes the column definition and strips the corresponding key from all existing row data. Cannot delete the last remaining column."},"1702":{"title":"List Rows","description":"Query rows from a table with optional filtering, sorting, and pagination. Filters and sorts are passed as JSON-encoded query parameters.","url":"/de/api-reference/tables/listRows","content":"List Rows — Query rows from a table with optional filtering, sorting, and pagination. Filters and sorts are passed as JSON-encoded query parameters."},"1703":{"title":"Insert Rows","description":"Insert one or more rows into a table. For a single row, pass a `data` object. For batch insert, pass a `rows` array (up to 1000 rows).","url":"/de/api-reference/tables/insertRows","content":"Insert Rows — Insert one or more rows into a table. For a single row, pass a `data` object. For batch insert, pass a `rows` array (up to 1000 rows)."},"1704":{"title":"Batch Update Rows","description":"Update multiple specific rows by their IDs in a single request. Each entry in the `updates` array specifies a row ID and the fields to update. Validates against the table schema and unique constraints. Up to 1000 rows can be updated per request.","url":"/de/api-reference/tables/batchUpdateRows","content":"Batch Update Rows — Update multiple specific rows by their IDs in a single request. Each entry in the `updates` array specifies a row ID and the fields to update. Validates against the table schema and unique constraints. Up to 1000 rows can be updated per request."},"1705":{"title":"Delete Rows","description":"Delete rows by filter criteria or by an explicit list of row IDs. Pass either a `filter` object or a `rowIds` array.","url":"/de/api-reference/tables/deleteRows","content":"Delete Rows — Delete rows by filter criteria or by an explicit list of row IDs. Pass either a `filter` object or a `rowIds` array."},"1706":{"title":"Update Rows","description":"Bulk update rows matching a filter. All matching rows will have the specified fields updated. Validates against schema and unique constraints.","url":"/de/api-reference/tables/updateRows","content":"Update Rows — Bulk update rows matching a filter. All matching rows will have the specified fields updated. Validates against schema and unique constraints."},"1707":{"title":"Get Row","description":"Retrieve a single row by its ID.","url":"/de/api-reference/tables/getRow","content":"Get Row — Retrieve a single row by its ID."},"1708":{"title":"Update Row","description":"Partially update a single row. Only th