d workflow. Supports synchronous, asynchronous, and streaming modes. For async execution, the response includes a statusUrl you can poll for results."},"2548":{"title":"Cancel Execution","description":"Cancel a running workflow execution. Only effective for executions that are still in progress.","url":"/zh/api-reference/workflows/cancelExecution","content":"Cancel Execution — Cancel a running workflow execution. Only effective for executions that are still in progress."},"2549":{"title":"List Paused Executions","description":"List all paused executions for a workflow. Workflows pause at Human in the Loop blocks and wait for input before continuing. Use this endpoint to discover which executions need attention.","url":"/zh/api-reference/human-in-the-loop/listPausedExecutions","content":"List Paused Executions — List all paused executions for a workflow. Workflows pause at Human in the Loop blocks and wait for input before continuing. Use this endpoint to discover which executions need attention."},"2550":{"title":"Get Paused Execution","description":"Get detailed information about a specific paused execution, including its pause points, execution snapshot, and resume queue. Use this to inspect the state before resuming.","url":"/zh/api-reference/human-in-the-loop/getPausedExecution","content":"Get Paused Execution — Get detailed information about a specific paused execution, including its pause points, execution snapshot, and resume queue. Use this to inspect the state before resuming."},"2551":{"title":"Get Paused Execution (Resume Path)","description":"Get detailed information about a specific paused execution using the resume URL path. Returns the same data as the workflow paused execution detail endpoint.","url":"/zh/api-reference/human-in-the-loop/getPausedExecutionByResumePath","content":"Get Paused Execution (Resume Path) — Get detailed information about a specific paused execution using the resume URL path. Returns the same data as the workflow paused execution detail endpoint."},"2552":{"title":"Get Pause Context","description":"Get detailed information about a specific pause context within a paused execution. Returns the pause point details, resume queue state, and any active resume entry.","url":"/zh/api-reference/human-in-the-loop/getPauseContext","content":"Get Pause Context — Get detailed information about a specific pause context within a paused execution. Returns the pause point details, resume queue state, and any active resume entry."},"2553":{"title":"Resume Execution","description":"Resume a paused workflow execution by providing input for a specific pause context. The execution continues from where it paused, using the provided input. Supports synchronous, asynchronous, and streaming modes (determined by the original execution's configuration).","url":"/zh/api-reference/human-in-the-loop/resumeExecution","content":"Resume Execution — Resume a paused workflow execution by providing input for a specific pause context. The execution continues from where it paused, using the provided input. Supports synchronous, asynchronous, and streaming modes (determined by the original execution's configuration)."},"2554":{"title":"List Workflows","description":"Retrieve all workflows in a workspace with cursor-based pagination.","url":"/zh/api-reference/workflows/listWorkflows","content":"List Workflows — Retrieve all workflows in a workspace with cursor-based pagination."},"2555":{"title":"Get Workflow","description":"Retrieve details for a single workflow, including its input fields and deployment status.","url":"/zh/api-reference/workflows/getWorkflow","content":"Get Workflow — Retrieve details for a single workflow, including its input fields and deployment status."},"2556":{"title":"Get Job Status","description":"Poll the status of an asynchronous workflow execution. Use the jobId returned from the Execute Workflow endpoint when the execution is queued asynchronously.","url":"/zh/api-reference/workflows/getJobStatus","content":"Get Job Status — Poll the status of an asynchronous workflow execution. Use the jobId returned from the Execute Workflow endpoint when the execution is queued asynchronously."},"2557":{"title":"Query Logs","description":"List workflow execution logs with advanced filtering and cursor-based pagination. Supports filtering by workflow, trigger type, date range, duration, cost, and more.","url":"/zh/api-reference/logs/queryLogs","content":"Query Logs — List workflow execution logs with advanced filtering and cursor-based pagination. Supports filtering by workflow, trigger type, date range, duration, cost, and more."},"2558":{"title":"Get Log Details","description":"Retrieve detailed information about a specific log entry, including workflow metadata, execution data, and cost breakdown.","url":"/zh/api-reference/logs/getLogDetails","content":"Get Log Details — Retrieve detailed information about a specific log entry, including workflow metadata, execution data, and cost breakdown."},"2559":{"title":"Get Execution Details","description":"Retrieve the full execution state snapshot, including the workflow state at time of execution and detailed metadata.","url":"/zh/api-reference/logs/getExecutionDetails","content":"Get Execution Details — Retrieve the full execution state snapshot, including the workflow state at time of execution and detailed metadata."},"2560":{"title":"List Audit Logs","description":"Retrieve audit logs for your organization with cursor-based pagination. Requires an Enterprise subscription and organization admin or owner role.","url":"/zh/api-reference/audit-logs/listAuditLogs","content":"List Audit Logs — Retrieve audit logs for your organization with cursor-based pagination. Requires an Enterprise subscription and organization admin or owner role."},"2561":{"title":"Get Audit Log Details","description":"Retrieve a single audit log entry by ID. Requires an Enterprise subscription and organization admin or owner role.","url":"/zh/api-reference/audit-logs/getAuditLogDetails","content":"Get Audit Log Details — Retrieve a single audit log entry by ID. Requires an Enterprise subscription and organization admin or owner role."},"2562":{"title":"Get Usage Limits","description":"Retrieve your current rate limits, usage spending, and storage consumption for the billing period.","url":"/zh/api-reference/usage/getUsageLimits","content":"Get Usage Limits — Retrieve your current rate limits, usage spending, and storage consumption for the billing period."},"2563":{"title":"List Tables","description":"List all tables in a workspace. Returns table metadata including name, schema, and row counts.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/listTables","content":"List Tables — List all tables in a workspace. Returns table metadata including name, schema, and row counts."},"2564":{"title":"Create Table","description":"Create a new table in a workspace. Define the table schema with typed columns, optional constraints (required, unique), and a name.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/createTable","content":"Create Table — Create a new table in a workspace. Define the table schema with typed columns, optional constraints (required, unique), and a name."},"2565":{"title":"Get Table","description":"Retrieve a table's metadata, schema, and row count.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/getTable","content":"Get Table — Retrieve a table's metadata, schema, and row count."},"2566":{"title":"Delete Table","description":"Delete a table and all its rows. This action is irreversible.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/deleteTable","content":"Delete Table — Delete a table and all its rows. This action is irreversible."},"2567":{"title":"Add Column","description":"Add a new column to the table schema. Optionally specify a position to insert the column at a specific index.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/addColumn","content":"Add Column — Add a new column to the table schema. Optionally specify a position to insert the column at a specific index."},"2568":{"title":"Update Column","description":"Update a column's name, type, or constraints. Multiple updates can be applied in a single request. When renaming, subsequent updates (type, constraints) use the new name.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/updateColumn","content":"Update Column — Update a column's name, type, or constraints. Multiple updates can be applied in a single request. When renaming, subsequent updates (type, constraints) use the new name."},"2569":{"title":"Delete Column","description":"Delete a column from the table schema. This removes the column definition and strips the corresponding key from all existing row data. Cannot delete the last remaining column.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/deleteColumn","content":"Delete Column — Delete a column from the table schema. This removes the column definition and strips the corresponding key from all existing row data. Cannot delete the last remaining column."},"2570":{"title":"List Rows","description":"Query rows from a table with optional filtering, sorting, and pagination. Filters and sorts are passed as JSON-encoded query parameters.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/listRows","content":"List Rows — Query rows from a table with optional filtering, sorting, and pagination. Filters and sorts are passed as JSON-encoded query parameters."},"2571":{"title":"Insert Rows","description":"Insert one or more rows into a table. For a single row, pass a `data` object. For batch insert, pass a `rows` array (up to 1000 rows).","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/insertRows","content":"Insert Rows — Insert one or more rows into a table. For a single row, pass a `data` object. For batch insert, pass a `rows` array (up to 1000 rows)."},"2572":{"title":"Batch Update Rows","description":"Update multiple specific rows by their IDs in a single request. Each entry in the `updates` array specifies a row ID and the fields to update. Validates against the table schema and unique constraints. Up to 1000 rows can be updated per request.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/batchUpdateRows","content":"Batch Update Rows — Update multiple specific rows by their IDs in a single request. Each entry in the `updates` array specifies a row ID and the fields to update. Validates against the table schema and unique constraints. Up to 1000 rows can be updated per request."},"2573":{"title":"Delete Rows","description":"Delete rows by filter criteria or by an explicit list of row IDs. Pass either a `filter` object or a `rowIds` array.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/deleteRows","content":"Delete Rows — Delete rows by filter criteria or by an explicit list of row IDs. Pass either a `filter` object or a `rowIds` array."},"2574":{"title":"Update Rows","description":"Bulk update rows matching a filter. All matching rows will have the specified fields updated. Validates against schema and unique constraints.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/updateRows","content":"Update Rows — Bulk update rows matching a filter. All matching rows will have the specified fields updated. Validates against schema and unique constraints."},"2575":{"title":"Get Row","description":"Retrieve a single row by its ID.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/getRow","content":"Get Row — Retrieve a single row by its ID."},"2576":{"title":"Update Row","description":"Partially update a single row. Only the provided fields are updated; existing fields are preserved. Data is validated against the table schema.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/updateRow","content":"Update Row — Partially update a single row. Only the provided fields are updated; existing fields are preserved. Data is validated against the table schema."},"2577":{"title":"Delete Row","description":"Delete a single row by its ID.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/deleteRow","content":"Delete Row — Delete a single row by its ID."},"2578":{"title":"Upsert Row","description":"Insert a new row or update an existing one based on a unique column value. The table must have at least one column with a unique constraint. If a row with a matching unique value exists, it is updated; otherwise, a new row is inserted. When multiple unique columns exist, specify `conflictTarget` to indicate which column to match on.","url":"/zh/api-reference/tables/upsertRow","content":"Upsert Row — Insert a new row or update an existing one based on a unique column value. The table must have at least one column with a unique constraint. If a row with a matching unique value exists, it is updated; otherwise, a new row is inserted. When multiple unique columns exist, specify `conflictTarget` to indicate which column to match on."},"2579":{"title":"List Files","description":"List all files in a workspace.","url":"/zh/api-reference/files/listFiles","content":"List Files — List all files in a workspace."},"2580":{"title":"Upload File","description":"Upload a file to a workspace. Send the file as multipart/form-data with a `file` field and a `workspaceId` field. Maximum file size is 100MB. Duplicate filenames within a workspace are not allowed.","url":"/zh/api-reference/files/uploadFile","content":"Upload File — Upload a file to a workspace. Send the file as multipart/form-data with a `file` field and a `workspaceId` field. Maximum file size is 100MB. Duplicate filenames within a workspace are not allowed."},"2581":{"title":"Download File","description":"Download a file's content. Returns the raw file bytes with appropriate Content-Type, Content-Disposition, and Content-Length headers. File metadata is included in custom response headers: X-File-Id, X-File-Name, X-Uploaded-At.","url":"/zh/api-reference/files/downloadFile","content":"Download File — Download a file's content. Returns the raw file bytes with appropriate Content-Type, Content-Disposition, and Content-Length headers. File metadata is included in custom response headers: X-File-Id, X-File-Name, X-Uploaded-At."},"2582":{"title":"Delete File","description":"Delete a file from a workspace. This removes both the file content and its metadata. This action is irreversible.","url":"/zh/api-reference/files/deleteFile","content":"Delete File — Delete a file from a workspace. This removes both the file content and its metadata. This action is irreversible."},"2583":{"title":"List Knowledge Bases","description":"List all knowledge bases in a workspace.","url":"/zh/api-reference/knowledge-bases/listKnowledgeBases","content":"List Knowledge Bases — List all knowledge bases in a workspace."},"2584":{"title":"Create Knowledge Base","description":"Create a new knowledge base in a workspace. Optionally configure chunking parameters for document processing.","url":"/zh/api-reference/knowledge-bases/createKnowledgeBase","content":"Create Knowledge Base — Create a new knowledge base in a workspace. Optionally configure chunking parameters for document processing."},"2585":{"title":"Get Knowledge Base","description":"Get details of a specific knowledge base.","url":"/zh/api-reference/knowledge-bases/getKnowledgeBase","content":"Get Knowledge Base — Get details of a specific knowledge base."},"2586":{"title":"Delete Knowledge Base","description":"Soft-delete a knowledge base and all its documents.","url":"/zh/api-reference/knowledge-bases/deleteKnowledgeBase","content":"Delete Knowledge Base — Soft-delete a knowledge base and all its documents."},"2587":{"title":"Update Knowledge Base","description":"Update a knowledge base's name, description, or chunking configuration. At least one field must be provided.","url":"/zh/api-reference/knowledge-bases/updateKnowledgeBase","content":"Update Knowledge Base — Update a knowledge base's name, description, or chunking configuration. At least one field must be provided."},"2588":{"title":"List Documents","description":"List documents in a knowledge base with pagination, filtering, and sorting.","url":"/zh/api-reference/knowledge-bases/listDocuments","content":"List Documents — List documents in a knowledge base with pagination, filtering, and sorting."},"2589":{"tit